		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4158&amp;p=32251#p32251"><![CDATA[
As far as we know all versions and variants of the MD9600 are the same. The volume control is a linear law pot not a log law pot as it should be.  <br><br>The only real fix is to replace the pot with the correct type. The manufacturers don't seem to be willing to do this. Possibly aa a cost saving exercise. <br><br>Colin G4EML<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Sun Jul 21, 2024 6:42 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
