Since the internal speaker is never loud enough for me in the mobile, the external speaker from MFJ "Clearspeak" sounds best. There is also the same speaker under different brand names (DxE)  available. It is significant better compared to the (not so bad) rectangle one i used before, mainly because it needs only about one third audio level for the same loudness. This keeps the audio distorsions low and make a  easier listening all day long in the 18wheeler.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=3963">VE4HTO</a> — Sat Jun 22, 2024 11:03 pm</p><hr />
